5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"Good morning, everyone. Before we rank these proposals, I’d like to understand what actually happened to our past awards.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Shizue"",""self"":true,""raw"":""**Shizue**: Good morning, everyone. Before we rank these proposals, I’d like to understand what actually happened to our past awards.""}]}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I agree. We should verify if the technical staff required for these projects are actually still available before committing funds.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I’m concerned about the shared infrastructure. We need to know if the facilities can actually support the workload before we commit.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
