39,2,1,talk,Midori,,The portfolio review shows breeding-based projects overrun twice as often as computation-focused ones.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Midori"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Midori: The portfolio review shows breeding-based projects overrun twice as often as computation-focused ones.""}]}"
